00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.500 align:start position:10%
<v Sarah>Thanks for joining us. How did the
project start?</v>

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.800 line:85%
<v Tom>It started with a question from a viewer:
why are captions on my phone so hard to read?</v>

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
<v Sarah>And what did you find?

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:18.000
<v.loud Tom>That the lines were cut for television,
<c.key>not</c> for a screen in portrait mode.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Sarah>Makes sense.</v> <v Tom>It does.</v>
